sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to reboot the Charging Station with status ImmediateAndResume

    CSMS->>CS: ResetRequest (status ImmediateAndResume)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: ResetRequest<br>type must be ImmediateAndResume
    CS-->>CSMS: ResetResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = ResetCommand, idToken omitted)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = RemoteReset)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: BootNotificationResponse<br>status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of all connectors
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest for Configured connectorId (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Occupied", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    loop For each other connector
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    CS->>CSMS: SecurityEventNotificationRequest (type = ResetOrReboot)
    CSMS-->>CS: SecurityEventNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = TxResumed, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging, idToken omitted)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
